        "projectNode": "M1-W01-C03-T2-V",
        "achievement": "Boundary RED turns GREEN, all C03 exact unit tests and the dw.quantities suite pass, foundation regressions pass, and compatibility limits are documented in durable evidence."
      },
      {
        "projectNode": "M1-W01-C03-T2",
        "achievement": "Direct DimensionVector overflow and tagged temperature absolute/interval boundary contracts are completed from independent RED through corrected implementation and verification."
      },
